01:40.940 --> 01:43.220
Yes, we've already scored one!

01:45.460 --> 01:46.580
Tsubasa!

01:50.300 --> 01:51.500
Nice pass!

02:13.450 --> 02:15.370
Come on, we're wasting time.

02:15.370 --> 02:16.580
Let's quickly get back to it.

02:16.940 --> 02:22.700
Rivaul, Tsuabsa Ohzora will turn into a nice rival for you.

02:22.700 --> 02:23.580
He will.

02:29.050 --> 02:31.540
I don't have the time to stop.

02:31.540 --> 02:33.660
I need to keep on running!

02:33.660 --> 02:38.440
I need to run so that I can realize my dream of winning the International Cup!

02:43.740 --> 02:48.860
<b>Go for 10 Goals, 10 Assists!</b>

02:43.740 --> 02:48.860
<b>Go for 10 Goals, 10 Assists!</b>

02:54.500 --> 02:58.380
Cataluña B's Mini Stadium

02:59.510 --> 03:02.200
He's already scored two?

03:02.200 --> 03:04.740
Is that you, Mendez? That's a rare sight.

03:05.770 --> 03:08.300
Hello, Serge-san.

03:08.300 --> 03:11.800
There's an interesting man in today's game.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.750
It's that Number 10!

03:13.750 --> 03:15.740
Yes, he's Tsubasa.

03:16.290 --> 03:18.160
Mendez, you know him?

03:18.160 --> 03:18.740
Yes.

03:19.430 --> 03:23.020
I've come here today to watch his Spanish debut.

03:29.730 --> 03:35.700
Tsubasa, playing for Cataluña, has already scored twice and is dribbling up the field!

03:39.340 --> 03:42.220
Oh, Tsubasa has such wonderful balance!

03:42.220 --> 03:45.220
The strong defensive marking can't do anything against him.

03:46.890 --> 03:49.140
Tsubasa with a really good pass to Sanchez!

03:49.140 --> 03:51.180
Nice pass, Tsubasa!

03:53.320 --> 03:55.490
Goal!

03:55.490 --> 03:58.210
Cataluña B score their third goal!

03:58.210 --> 03:59.380
All right!

03:59.380 --> 04:01.740
Nice assist, Tsubasa!

04:02.490 --> 04:06.220
3 - 0. The lead keeps getting bigger.

04:13.400 --> 04:17.530
What's this? The referee decides FC La Mancha is at fault.

04:17.530 --> 04:18.780
Damn it!

04:21.200 --> 04:27.460
Now Cataluña B have an excellent angle to shoot this free kick!

04:28.770 --> 04:30.980
As expected, the kick taker is Tsubasa.

04:34.620 --> 04:36.660
This opening game in the second division...

04:37.780 --> 04:41.690
If this is my start in Europe,

04:41.690 --> 04:43.950
then I'll go at it with everything I've got!

04:45.460 --> 04:49.260
And I'll show them I'm good enough for the main team!

04:56.240 --> 04:57.910
Goal!

04:57.910 --> 05:00.060
What amazing control!

05:00.060 --> 05:04.340
By the 28th minute, Tsubasa has already scored a hat trick!

05:04.340 --> 05:06.460
Bravo, Tsubasa!

05:06.460 --> 05:08.820
Score as many you want!

05:09.500 --> 05:11.340
Tsubasa...

05:11.340 --> 05:14.900
Very well, let's keep on scoring!

05:14.900 --> 05:16.340
Yeah!

05:16.340 --> 05:19.700
That's what our captain wants to do!

05:20.860 --> 05:24.140
That's the way! Score lots more!

05:25.360 --> 05:27.340
How about that, La Mancha?

05:28.410 --> 05:29.780
Damn it...

05:30.310 --> 05:31.850
Those...!

05:38.580 --> 05:42.580
Lead by Tsubasa, Cataluña's B team is in control of the game.

05:42.580 --> 05:45.280
They're like the Mini Stadium Gang.

05:46.120 --> 05:48.610
This is, without doubt, the team's reincarnation.

05:50.770 --> 05:52.380
It's the Mini Stadium Gang.

05:53.380 --> 05:56.380
Yes, they're just like that team from before!

05:57.130 --> 06:01.460
Yes, Cataluña B was once called

06:02.580 --> 06:04.300
the "Mini Stadium Gang."

06:05.300 --> 06:09.230
Under that name, talented players were formed here at Cataluña B,

06:09.230 --> 06:12.500
before entering the main team.

06:12.500 --> 06:17.020
That team really launched a new era of soccer.

06:17.630 --> 06:24.900
The Mini Stadium Gang is getting reborn right now around Tsubasa.

06:26.540 --> 06:30.900
All of the players who led that gang

06:30.900 --> 06:35.160
have had good careers on the main team.

06:35.860 --> 06:37.930
Will Tsubasa, too?

06:38.780 --> 06:39.940
I believe so.

06:44.020 --> 06:46.080
I do, too.

06:50.340 --> 06:55.100
-Germany- Practice Field of FC Grunwald

07:07.220 --> 07:09.220
What's wrong, Kartz?

07:13.100 --> 07:16.220
Let's have a break, Gen-san.

07:16.220 --> 07:19.630
Hey, hey. It's a bit early to pack it in.


07:19.630 --> 07:24.380
But how many hours have we been practicing since morning?

07:24.380 --> 07:26.850
I really can't keep up with you.

07:27.740 --> 07:31.690
I got it. I got it. Let's have a ten-minute break.

07:35.710 --> 07:39.650
It should be around the end of the first half in Tsubasa's game.

07:47.050 --> 07:49.880
Is tomorrow the day when you finally start the season?

07:49.880 --> 07:55.620
Yes, I'll be starting my European debut in the second division, but I'll do my best.

07:55.620 --> 07:56.620
Tsubasa.

07:56.640 --> 07:57.620
Yes?

07:58.290 --> 08:03.820
The challenge given to you by your coach, those ten goals and ten assists,

08:04.190 --> 08:08.630
try to achieve that in the first game, using your strong feelings.

08:09.300 --> 08:13.180
Yes, that's my intention.

08:14.680 --> 08:18.160
I thought being on the reserve team would depress him.

08:20.670 --> 08:22.190
That Tsubasa...

08:29.180 --> 08:32.620
We can't let him score any more!

08:32.620 --> 08:33.220
Yeah!

08:37.840 --> 08:39.320
A splendid move from Tsubasa!

08:39.320 --> 08:39.950
And...

08:41.300 --> 08:42.460
he's through!

08:42.460 --> 08:43.170
I won't let you!

08:46.260 --> 08:47.900
Tsubasa evades the keeper...

08:47.900 --> 08:48.820
What?

08:49.310 --> 08:50.860
Get in!

08:52.230 --> 08:54.700
Goal! Goal!

08:55.810 --> 08:59.180
Tsubasa scores his fourth goal right at the start of the second half!

08:59.180 --> 09:04.010
Cataluña's B takes a 5 - 0 lead, and La Mancha is overwhelmed!

09:05.260 --> 09:07.220
Yahoo!

09:10.700 --> 09:13.260
Nice play, Tsubasa!

09:13.260 --> 09:16.270
T-That guy's incredible!

09:17.980 --> 09:19.860
Awesome!

09:23.990 --> 09:25.660
Tsubasa is in front of the goal yet again!

09:25.660 --> 09:27.380
I won't let you!

09:30.920 --> 09:33.330
Serrano receives Tsubasa's pass.

09:33.330 --> 09:34.380
He gets ready to shoot...

09:34.380 --> 09:36.060
I've got it!

09:36.950 --> 09:39.850
It's in! Goal!

09:39.850 --> 09:41.440
6 - 0!

09:41.440 --> 09:43.820
Cataluña's too strong!

09:44.910 --> 09:45.830
All right!

09:46.500 --> 09:47.860
Yahoo!

09:49.020 --> 09:51.860
Four goals and two assists down!

09:54.010 --> 09:57.340
So you did come, Gonzales?

09:58.110 --> 09:59.470
You guys, too?

10:00.340 --> 10:02.700
We were kind of curious.

10:03.340 --> 10:07.100
After having seen this game,

10:07.100 --> 10:10.530
won't Coach Edward let Tsubasa join the main team?

10:28.100 --> 10:29.570
Push forward!

10:32.310 --> 10:36.330
Nothing obligates you to stay in Cataluña or in Spain, Tsubasa.

10:37.460 --> 10:41.590
Come to Italy. The Italian League is one of the best in the world!

10:42.370 --> 10:47.980
There are many teams who don't have a leader and would want you!

10:48.530 --> 10:50.980
Thank you, Hyuga-kun.

10:53.180 --> 10:54.540
But I still...

10:57.140 --> 10:58.860
don't want to leave!

11:00.610 --> 11:06.070
This is not how I want to leave Spain and Barcelona.

11:13.540 --> 11:15.150
I'll show the coach,

11:18.420 --> 11:20.250
and Rivaul-san,

11:21.340 --> 11:26.860
I'll show you all how I <i>really</i> play soccer without holding back!

11:37.120 --> 11:41.000
Just like I promised myself, I'll show you all...

11:43.420 --> 11:48.660
the coach, my teammates, and everybody else,

11:59.580 --> 12:00.380
how...

12:06.140 --> 12:11.220
how I <i>really</i> play soccer without holding back!

12:11.860 --> 12:14.020
Here. Take it, Tsubasa!

12:15.400 --> 12:16.960
I'll show everyone...

12:18.900 --> 12:20.020
how I play!

12:23.490 --> 12:27.760
It's in! Tsubasa scores with a strong jumping header!

12:27.760 --> 12:30.310
That makes his fifth goal!

12:30.310 --> 12:33.800
Nobody can stop this man anymore!

12:38.880 --> 13:00.860
Tsubasa! Tsubasa! Tsubasa!{top time it, and it would be cool to alpha time it all, but not nesscary, -san}

12:39.900 --> 12:46.090
Listen to how the name of an Asian player is being called out here in Cataluña, Spain!

12:46.090 --> 12:50.160
His name is Tsubasa... Tsubasa Ohzora!

12:50.160 --> 12:56.230
His fabulous play has won over the entire crowd!

13:08.300 --> 13:10.540
Go for it, Serrano!

13:10.540 --> 13:12.030
Okay!

13:13.260 --> 13:15.340
Goal!

13:15.340 --> 13:20.340
What a nice through pass from Tsubasa to his teammate!

13:20.340 --> 13:23.870
The goalkeeper had no chance of saving it.

13:26.020 --> 13:28.270
Go for it, Tsubasa!

13:28.270 --> 13:30.620
Keep scoring more!

13:34.620 --> 13:36.360
What a guy!

13:36.360 --> 13:41.370
He doesn't slow down while dribbling. Instead, he actually accelerates!

13:53.500 --> 13:55.430
Another one's in!

13:55.430 --> 13:57.020
Bravo, Tsubasa!

13:57.020 --> 14:01.250
He quickly dribbles up the field and draws the goalkeeper with his exquisite cross pass!

14:01.250 --> 14:04.060
Another goal has been scored!

14:08.500 --> 14:10.380
Hey, that's...

14:11.240 --> 14:13.610
Rivaul's Submarine Defense!

14:14.810 --> 14:16.620
Tsubasa...

14:16.620 --> 14:19.140
I've had enough of this!

14:25.620 --> 14:26.900
What!?

14:26.900 --> 14:28.740
The Rivaul Turn!?

14:30.450 --> 14:35.420
Has he completely made all of my techniques his?

14:41.210 --> 14:44.760
Splendid passing from Cataluña B, and...

14:44.760 --> 14:47.530
Tsubasa, once again, runs after the ball and the goal!

14:47.530 --> 14:50.140
But the ball's a bit high.

14:50.780 --> 14:55.300
No, that pass was meant for an overhead kick!

14:54.960 --> 14:58.020
Get in!

14:58.020 --> 15:00.820
There it is: the overhead kick!

15:03.630 --> 15:06.570
And it's a goal!

15:06.570 --> 15:10.050
It's Tsubasa's sixth goal!

15:10.050 --> 15:13.060
He's obtained a double hat-trick!

15:14.430 --> 15:18.820
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

15:18.820 --> 15:20.700
Perfect!

15:44.260 --> 15:46.510
Wait? I don't believe this...

15:46.510 --> 15:48.280
He still wants to keep on going?

15:50.250 --> 15:52.260
Please have mercy!

15:52.770 --> 15:53.850
Tsubasa.

15:54.970 --> 15:57.700
It's enough now. Time's up.

15:58.220 --> 15:59.940
O-Okay.

16:00.490 --> 16:04.860
Oh, the referee takes the ball from Tsubasa.

16:04.860 --> 16:07.590
He whistles the end of the game.

16:12.420 --> 16:14.390
10 - 0!

16:14.390 --> 16:19.940
Cataluña B win their first game in the Spanish League's Second Division in a crushing way.

16:19.940 --> 16:21.970
You did it, Tsubasa!

16:21.970 --> 16:23.380
We won big!

16:23.380 --> 16:30.230
And Cataluña B's captain, Tsubasa Ohzora, scored 6 goals and made 4 assists.

16:30.230 --> 16:34.380
With each and every goal, he showed proof of phenomenal talent!

16:34.380 --> 16:40.500
Even he surely can't have been expecting such a result.

16:43.140 --> 16:49.080
To score 10 goals and 10 assists in one game really is impossible.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.620
Tsubasa.

16:57.420 --> 17:03.100
Whatever the game, you always give it your all.

17:03.100 --> 17:09.540
And wherever you are, you really enjoy playing soccer.

17:11.900 --> 17:15.900
I'm happy that we stayed!

17:21.830 --> 17:28.050
He'll be in the headlines with an exploit like this, even in the second division.

17:33.470 --> 17:38.260
Hyuga-kun, excuse me. I'm Nozaki from Toto Sports.

17:38.260 --> 17:41.580
Are you on your way to see Ohzora Tsubasa?

17:42.260 --> 17:45.260
No, I'm not going to see him now.

17:49.100 --> 17:53.010
As expected, Tsubasa does not belong in the second division.

17:53.750 --> 17:56.650
He'll surely join the main team soon.

17:57.480 --> 17:59.340
I can't just hang around.

18:00.020 --> 18:03.900
Right after I get back to Italy, I'll start reworking my body.

18:06.300 --> 18:07.960
Whoa!

18:06.750 --> 18:09.520
How's that? Did you all see that?

18:09.520 --> 18:11.500
Tsubasa's awesome, isn't he?

18:11.500 --> 18:15.420
Ohzora Tsubasa

18:11.500 --> 18:15.420
This is the ball he signed and gave me.

18:16.420 --> 18:17.900
You're lucky!

18:17.900 --> 18:20.340
I'd like one, too!

18:21.850 --> 18:23.380
Pinto!

18:23.380 --> 18:25.720
Thanks for cheering me on!

18:27.220 --> 18:29.220
It's Tsubasa!

18:29.760 --> 18:30.820
Tsubasa!

18:30.820 --> 18:34.020
You know Tsubasa?

18:34.020 --> 18:35.840
Yes, I do!

18:36.620 --> 19:22.500
Tsubasa! Tsubasa! Tsubasa!

18:37.260 --> 18:42.750
Spanish friends from Cataluña, I'm honestly thankful for your cheering during today's game!

18:49.090 --> 18:51.080
10 - 0, huh?

18:51.080 --> 18:53.620
What a triumphant debut!

18:55.010 --> 18:59.030
Tsubasa, you don't belong here.

18:59.030 --> 19:01.140
Hurry up and join the main team!

19:02.020 --> 19:07.910
Tsubasa, you really let me see the way you play soccer during this game.

19:09.870 --> 19:13.160
Tsubasa, your debut doesn't surprise me.

19:23.200 --> 19:27.980
Guys, I've got great news. We'll be getting a bonus for today's game!

19:31.020 --> 19:32.500
All right!

19:33.350 --> 19:37.560
Let's keep this momentum and win the next game, Captain!

19:37.560 --> 19:38.500
Yes!

19:38.500 --> 19:41.350
All right! Let's get our bonuses!

19:41.350 --> 19:42.500
Yeah!

19:45.150 --> 19:46.500
Tsubasa Ohzora.

19:47.540 --> 19:48.730
There's a call for you.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.730
Okay.

19:56.160 --> 19:58.260
Hey, Tsubasa.

19:58.260 --> 20:00.020
Ah, it's you, Wakabayashi-kun!

20:00.720 --> 20:03.600
I was thinking your game would be over by now.

20:03.600 --> 20:04.780
So, how did it go?

20:05.350 --> 20:06.140
I failed.

20:06.140 --> 20:07.780
"Failed"?

20:12.260 --> 20:13.780
Idiot!

20:13.780 --> 20:19.820
Don't say you failed when you scored a double hat-trick and made 4 assists!

20:19.820 --> 20:23.580
If the opponent keeper heard that, he'd be crying and very upset!

20:23.580 --> 20:24.580
Geez.

20:25.970 --> 20:29.020
Sorry, sorry. But I promised you I'd do it.

20:30.580 --> 20:33.300
Second division players are still professionals.

20:33.300 --> 20:39.180
They're not going to let you score 10 goals and 10 assists during a game that easily.

20:39.180 --> 20:40.260
That's true.

20:40.260 --> 20:41.940
If you keep going like that,

20:41.940 --> 20:44.500
you'll have achieved your quota before you know it.

20:44.500 --> 20:47.260
Yeah, I'll do that in the next game.

20:47.260 --> 20:50.660
Yeah, hurry up and join the main team.

20:50.660 --> 20:51.800
I will.

20:58.720 --> 21:03.250
I will obtain a place as a regular player on the main team!

21:04.100 --> 21:08.950
We went abroad for that purpose, didn't we, Tsubasa?

21:10.090 --> 21:14.740
Tsubasa is in Spain. Wakabyashi is in Germany, and I'm in Italy.

21:15.620 --> 21:18.940
And each of us only want one thing:

21:18.940 --> 21:21.910
to win the International Cup!

21:39.760 --> 21:41.580
I'm up next.

21:42.310 --> 21:46.780
Schneider, I won't let you score a single goal during tomorrow's game!

22:04.020 --> 22:11.260
Preview

22:05.680 --> 22:07.220
Grünwald, where Wakabayashi-kun plays,

22:07.220 --> 22:11.540
is up against Rotburg, the team of his old foe, Karl Heinz Schneider.

22:11.540 --> 22:15.420
It will be a new top game for both teams since the German League opener.

22:15.420 --> 22:18.420
A battle between two men's pride is about to start.

22:19.140 --> 22:20.740
Keep it up, Wakabayashi-kun!

22:20.740 --> 22:24.180
Your tenacity to win makes Japanese soccer stronger.

22:24.660 --> 22:26.340
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:26.340 --> 22:27.540
Battle Between Rivals

22:26.540 --> 22:34.180
Battle Between Rivals

22:27.540 --> 22:29.220
Look forward to it!

22:29.220 --> 22:31.910
Let's face our future! Kick off!

23:02.740 --> 23:08.940
<b>Nervously looking up in the darkness, I sway</b>

23:02.740 --> 23:08.940
<b>Nervously looking up in the darkness, I sway</b>

23:08.940 --> 23:14.740
<b>as my reckless past haunts me.</b>

23:08.940 --> 23:14.740
<b>as my reckless past haunts me.</b>

23:14.740 --> 23:21.020
<b>Remember what you pledged to the sky.</b>

23:14.740 --> 23:21.020
<b>Remember what you pledged to the sky.</b>

23:21.020 --> 23:24.940
<b>Find your way.</b>

23:21.020 --> 23:24.940
<b>Find your way.</b>

23:27.500 --> 23:29.860
<b>Sing and dance.</b>

23:27.500 --> 23:29.860
<b>Sing and dance.</b>

23:29.860 --> 23:32.300
<b>You have to try what you want to do first.</b>

23:29.860 --> 23:32.300
<b>You have to try what you want to do first.</b>

23:33.740 --> 23:35.740
<b>Don't forget your dream.</b>

23:33.740 --> 23:35.740
<b>Don't forget your dream.</b>

23:35.740 --> 23:38.260
<b>Risk everything you have and walk your own path.</b>

23:35.740 --> 23:38.260
<b>Risk everything you have and walk your own path.</b>

23:39.940 --> 23:41.820
<b>Don't run away from here.</b>

23:39.940 --> 23:41.820
<b>Don't run away from here.</b>

